# Executive assessment

I audited the supplied `Archive(20260926-043000).zip` against the production-readiness brief you attached. I have **not modified the repository**, consistent with the explicit audit-first requirement. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="0"}

The application is substantially more mature than an early-stage prototype. The core Provider → Offering separation is coherent, the affiliate architecture is much safer than the earlier link-based design, comparison identity/canonicalisation has dedicated regression checks, the CMS sanitises article HTML on both write/read paths, admin access has independent proxy and server-side checks, the sitemap filters `noIndex`, and there are meaningful production-readiness/security scripts.

However, I would **not launch the current repository as production-ready yet**.

